rlikte, aslı olan Arapça metinle aynen verilmiştir.</p><section><h2>Şeyhülislam İbn Teymiyye</h2><h3>Başkalarından naklettikleri</h3><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">طائفة من السلف</span> <span class=\"st\">أقرّه</span> «هم الذين يؤخرونها عن وقتها.»<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 22/29</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">بعض السلف</span> <span class=\"st\">حكاه</span> «هم الذين لا يؤدونها على الوجه المأمور به.»<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 22/29</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=tr#s107a4\">Etkileşimli tefsirde aç (tam metinler)</a><div class=\"pn\"><span></span><a href=\"/tr/ayah/107-5.html\">Sonraki âyet (107:5)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tefsîru&#x27;ş-Şeyhayn · <a href=\"/tr/\">Ana sayfa</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Proje hakkında</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Gizlilik ve şartlar</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/107-5.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"tr\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tefsiri: Al-Maa&#x27;un 107:5 — İbn Teymiyye ve İbnü&#x27;l-Kayyim&#x27;e göre</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Onlar kıldıkları namazdan gafildirler.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/107-5.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/107-5.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/107-5.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/107-5.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/107-5.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/107-5.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\